  "bio": "Step into the artistic haven of Chez Simone Tattoo, nestled in the heart of Grenoble, France, where the ink comes to life. Specializing in intricate realism, bold black & gray, and classic traditional styles, our doors swing open from Monday to Friday, 10 AM to 5 PM, with Saturdays dedicated to appointments. For a truly personalized experience, visit us at 18 Lakanal to discuss your design — and remember, to keep the creativity flowing, we kindly request that you speak with us in person, as we do not respond to DMs.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Grenoble, Auvergne-rhone-alpes, France\n\nMaison chrétienne de tatouage 💒♥️ 66 rue des trois visages, Arras - lundi au vendredi - 10-17h - ♥️ 0624515870 ♥️",
